pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 36, 400, 16]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: EXPERT PANEL}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 56, 848, 36]
    content: {style: "$pageTitle", wrap: false, text: 专家团：六位大师同席，分歧摆上台面}
  - elementId: title-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 102, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 124, 560, 44]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      text: |
        <p>底层是 ai-hedge-fund 的多模型架构：每位大师独立给出 [-1, 1] 多空信号与文字理由，组合经理再汇总成仓位。终端把这个过程做成了可视化面板。</p>
  - elementId: table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [56, 180, 560, 210]
    columnWidths: [0.26, 0.2, 0.54]
    rowHeights: [0.16, 0.14, 0.14, 0.14, 0.14, 0.14, 0.14]
    style:
      cellStyle: {fontSize: 11.5, color: "$body", align: [left, middle]}
      firstRowStyle: {bold: true, color: "$muted", fontSize: 11, border: [null, null, {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}, null]}
      bodyStyles:
        - {border: [null, null, {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$faint"}, null]}
    rows:
      - - text: 模型
        - text: 立场*
        - text: 核心理由（AAPL 示例）
      - - text: 格雷厄姆
        - {text: "看空 -0.35", color: "#2ebd85"}
        - text: 估值无安全边际，不符合防御型标准
      - - text: 巴菲特
        - {text: "看多 +0.75", color: "#e54545"}
        - text: 生态锁定现金流，回购缩减股本
      - - text: 芒格
        - {text: "看多 +0.50", color: "#e54545"}
        - text: 品牌+理性回购，警惕监管反身性
      - - text: 彼得·林奇
        - {text: "看多 +0.30", color: "#e54545"}
        - text: 稳健增长股，PEG 偏贵但可跟踪
      - - text: 德鲁肯米勒
        - {text: "看多 +0.20", color: "#e54545"}
        - text: 防御配置价值，等待宏观赔率
      - - text: 财报漂移(量化)
        - {text: "看多 +0.25", color: "#e54545"}
        - text: SUE 61 分位，公告后漂移温和为正
  - elementId: table-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 396, 560, 30]
    content: {style: "$small", text: "*未配 FINANCIAL_DATASETS_API_KEY 时展示内置示例数据并在界面明确标注；配 key 后同一按钮即为真实 aihf 推理，结果落盘 records/ 供复盘。"}
  - elementId: points
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 436, 560, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: |
        <p>· 每位专家一张卡：平均立场 + 强度条 + 逐标的理由，<strong>分歧不被和稀泥</strong></p>
        <p>· 底部附组合经理结论：action 与目标权重，信号到仓位的链路完整可见</p>
  - elementId: shot
    elementType: image
    bounds: [648, 124, 256, 360]
    src: media/experts-panel.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    crop: {top: 0.0, bottom: 0.0}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: shot-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 490, 256, 14]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "专家团面板实拍"}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 512, 34, 14]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: "04"}
